WEBVTT

00:15:57.546 --> 00:16:00.611
and about the plight that they
will face in America,

00:16:00.611 --> 00:16:04.396
not only if they lived in Egypt
or a foreign country,

00:16:04.396 --> 00:16:06.602
in having equal rights,

00:16:06.602 --> 00:16:08.935
and I hope that all of you will join me

00:16:08.935 --> 00:16:12.662
in being a champion for women
and girls around the world


00:16:12.662 --> 00:16:14.217
and protect their human rights.

00:16:14.217 --> 00:16:17.189
Thank you very much.

00:16:17.189 --> 00:16:21.189
(Applause)